WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.860
It's late.

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.370
You've sent another application

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:03.260
into the dark.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.360
No reply.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.490
No pay listed.

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.710
A job that may never have been real.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.360
Job hunting shouldn't feel like guessing.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.140
That's why we built Steady Path Careers,

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.060
job search help for New Jersey and New York.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.270
Start with Find Your Fit,

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.300
a quiz that shows which kinds of work

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.870
match your interests.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:23.360
Then every week,

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.590
5 to 10 real openings.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.510
We check each one on the employer's own site,

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.390
and show the pay as posted.

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.040
Say yes to a job,

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:33.870
and your resume and cover letter

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:35.190
are tailored for it,

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:37.240
with interview prep included.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:40.140
Track every application in your own portal.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:42.780
And use our free tools anytime,

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.580
like the fake-job checker.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.320
You stay in control.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:48.880
You send every application yourself.

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:50.260
Your next job,

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.450
one honest step at a time.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:56.720
Start free for 14 days at steadypathcareers.com.
